#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_parallax
msgid ""
"<i>“One of the great beauties of architecture is that each time, it is like "
"life starting all over again.”</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>“Ena od velikih lepot arhitekture je, da je vsakič, kot da se življenje "
"začenja znova.”</i>"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_banner
msgid "A Different Viewpoint."
msgstr "Drugačen pogled"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_call_to_action
msgid "As <b>436 clients</b> before you, let’s work together"
msgstr "Kot <b>436 strank</b> pred vami, sodelujmo skupaj"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_text_image
msgid "Building Castle in Cloud"
msgstr "Gradnja gradu v oblaku"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid "Construction site"
msgstr "Gradbišče"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_picture
msgid "Creating places that enhance the human experience."
msgstr "Ustvarjanje prostorov, ki izboljšujejo človeško izkušnjo."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_banner
msgid "Discover More"
msgstr "Odkrijte več"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.enark_snippet_options
msgid "Gradients"
msgstr ""

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid "Know our clients."
msgstr "Spoznajte naše stranke."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid "Nature friendly"
msgstr "Naravi prijazno"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.enark_snippet_options
msgid "None"
msgstr "Brez"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid ""
"Our creations integrate and are in perfect harmony with their environment."
msgstr ""
"Naše stvaritve se vključujejo v svoje okolje in so z njim v popolni "
"harmoniji."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid ""
"Our mastery of construction techniques has been built up over time through "
"our close collaboration with the workers and our sustained presence on the "
"construction sites."
msgstr ""
"Naše obvladovanje gradbenih tehnik se je skozi čas izoblikovalo z našim "
"tesnim sodelovanjem z delavci in našo stalno prisotnostjo na gradbiščih."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_enark.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "Pomožni pripomočki teme"

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_picture
msgid "We always put people and nature at the center of our projects."
msgstr "V naših projektih vedno postavljamo ljudi in naravo v središče."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_media_list
msgid ""
"We always start by exploring our clients goals, priorities, lifestyle, and "
"tastes."
msgstr ""
"Vedno začnemo s preučevanjem ciljev, prioritet, življenjskega sloga in okusa "
"naših strank."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_banner
msgid ""
"We are a contemporary architecture firm working mainly in the residential, "
"commercial and office sectors. Our projects are built all over the world, in"
" urban and rural environments."
msgstr ""
"Smo sodoben arhitekturni biro, ki deluje predvsem na področju stanovanjskih, "
"poslovnih in pisarniških prostorov. Naši projekti nastajajo po vsem svetu, v "
"urbanih in podeželskih okoljih."

#. module: theme_enark
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_enark.s_text_image
msgid ""
"When designing an architectural concept, we take into account the nine "
"criteria that Zumthor considers to be important in creating an architectural"
" atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"Pri oblikovanju arhitekturnega koncepta upoštevamo devet kriterijev, ki jih "
"Zumthor ocenjuje kot pomembne pri ustvarjanju arhitekturnega vzdušja."
